01","n":"0567b","t":"故能生現在集諦故當知阿賴"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0567c01","n":"0567c","t":"阿賴耶識體是無常有取受性"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0568a01","n":"0568a","t":"謂阿羅漢獨覺不退轉菩薩及"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0568b01","n":"0568b","t":"論曰當知心散亂有六種心安"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0568c01","n":"0568c","t":"是乃至隨行等三當知識非識"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0569a01","n":"0569a","t":"經言若於此受即於此思若於"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0569b01","n":"0569b","t":"屬心相七世間相八不可思議"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0569c01","n":"0569c","t":"論於實相處起如言眼之識身"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0570a01","n":"0570a","t":"諸物發起如是六種言論當知"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0570b01","n":"0570b","t":"有多種相者謂若由此為先此"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0570c01","n":"0570c","t":"業者如眼之見業如是所餘諸"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0571a01","n":"0571a","t":"心心所有法所緣境是所緣緣"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0571b01","n":"0571b","t":"是故依領受依處建立觀待因"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0571c01","n":"0571c","t":"所應盡當知如是無記之法能"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0572a01","n":"0572a","t":"熟果及等流果依真實見因依"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0572b01","n":"0572b","t":"滅等四種離繫者謂緣差脫畢"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0572c01","n":"0572c","t":"多世界共一各二種因緣論曰"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0573a01","n":"0573a","t":"皆是俱生非分別起是有覆無"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0573b01","n":"0573b","t":"異生性十九由離欲二十由受"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0573c01","n":"0573c","t":"論曰由四種因故說名隨眠一"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0574a01","n":"0574a","t":"報當知四種先後報熟所謂最"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.edu.tw/zh/T31n1602_p0574b01","n":"0574b","t":"復次頌曰依餘有所緣染污心"},{"h":"https://cbetaonline.dila.e